From 97a9eeecdfda8a4d2e108c9e0cd53016deaa2012 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 22:34:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(workflow): hydrate source-row facts before matching and
 running workflows

Live enqueue still stores {op, table} for several triggers. Copy location and
condition facts from the tenant source row so location-scoped definitions and
coverage/inventory/waste/repair conditions can evaluate without waiting on
schema migrations. Tenant-scoped; does not invent swapRole or conflictCount.
